+- **KHQR inspection exports** — `inspectKhqrPayload()` (decoded summary incl. `crcValid`/`valid`, static-vs-dynamic, amount, currency, merchant fields; `undefined` when malformed), `validateKhqrCrc()`, and `khqrCrc16()` from `src/khqr-offline.ts`.
+- **`doctor` ABA KHQR readiness row** — advisory check reporting how many of the 7 ABA-issued fields are configured: fully unconfigured is healthy ("optional"), a **partial** configuration fails the row with the exact missing `PAYWAY_KHQR_*` variables (every `--offline` run would fail). Mirrors the agent readiness matrix's existing `offlineKhqr` row.
